      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes I\u0027m aware of the DAMP rule but there will be too many individual targets. We will eventually map the corresponding soong targets in Android.bp here. https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:external/linux-kselftest/Android.bp?q\u003dandroid.bp%20file:selftest, and in addition consider the composition increase when we support more abi.\n\nGoing forward this abi rule may be used by other tests because that creates a standard directory structure compatible with tradefed testdir structure. But let\u0027s put it here as private for now. We may later move it to a proper place when need comes.",
